                "annotations": [],
                "text": "An analysis of the training examples reveals the following rule:\n\nFor each non-zero pixel in the grid, count how many orthogonal neighbors (up, down, left, right) share the exact same color.\n- If the count is **$\\ge 2$**, the pixel is **kept**.\n- If the count is **$< 2$**, the pixel is **removed** (set to `0`).\n\nReady for the test inputs!",
